    "description": "It would seem that the life of Roma, an unlucky businessman, is finally about to take a turn for the better—but the constant, demanding whims of four gnomes leave him no time for anything else. Everything changes, however, when Roma discovers a magic mirror in a dusty library and inadvertently sets free a gnome named Lovkarius. This new \"business partner\" offers Roma exactly what he has long dreamed of: a quest to find the mysterious cave of Ali Baba, which promises to free him from all his obligations. The path there, however, does not lead through airports or train stations, but rather through a series of \"little pranks\" that require theft and deception. While Roma—swayed by the smooth-talking gnome’s promises of untold riches and fame—flees to Dubai, his wife, Natasha, and daughter, Varya, set off in pursuit alongside the gnomes, determined to save Roma not only from the perils of the desert but also from himself.",
